  "statement_html": "<div class=\"wims_instruction\"><img style=\"float:left;width:20px;height:20px;\" src=\"/api/static/gifs/calculator_not.svg\" alt=\"Calculatrices interdites\" >\t<strong>La calculatrice n'est pas autorisée, ni le brouillon.</strong>\t<br><u>Aide à la saisie :</u> saisir 3/4 pour \\(\\frac{3}{4}\\)</div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply1\">Question 1:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Lequel de ces nombres est le plus proche de 2990 &#63;\t   <span class=\"oef-menu\" name=\"reply1\" data-label=\"\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply2\">Question 2:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Le double de \\(105\\) &#58;\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply3\">Question 3:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Choisis la longueur possible d'un autocar &#63;\t   <span class=\"oef-menu\" name=\"reply3\" data-label=\"\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply4\">Question 4:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  On distribue équitablement 28 cartes à 4 joueurs. <STRONG>Combien de cartes aura chaque joueur </STRONG> &#63;\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply5\">Question 5:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Ecris un nombre en chiffre dans lequel on entend \"cent\" et \"mille\".\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply6\">Question 6:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(196+304={}\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply7\">Question 7:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Un cours commence à 15 h 50 et se termine à 16 h 30.<br><STRONG> Combien de temps dure ce cours &#63;</STRONG><br>\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"10\"></span> minutes.</div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply8\">Question 8:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(763-711={}\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply8\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply9\">Question 9:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Dans \\(24\\), combien de fois \\(6\\) &#63;\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply9\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply10\">Question 10:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\"><span class=\"pax-fig-group\">\t  Figure 1 : <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\"><image x=\"0.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" href=\"data:image/gif;base64,\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"49.07,86.40 62.64,61.09 65.47,46.80 57.36,58.91\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"49.07,86.40 62.64,61.09 65.47,46.80 57.36,58.91\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><polygon points=\"22.86,60.00 60.00,62.29 74.29,60.00 60.00,57.71\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"22.86,60.00 60.00,62.29 74.29,60.00 60.00,57.71\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><circle cx=\"60.00\" cy=\"60.00\" r=\"6.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><line x1=\"60.00\" y1=\"74.29\" x2=\"60.00\" y2=\"8.57\" stroke=\"#ff0000\" stroke-width=\"2.0\" /><circle cx=\"60.00\" cy=\"60.00\" r=\"3.50\" fill=\"#ff0000\" stroke=\"none\" /></svg></span><span class=\"pax-fig-group\"> Figure 2 : <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\"><image x=\"0.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" href=\"data:image/gif;base64,\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"33.60,70.93 61.09,62.64 73.20,54.53 58.91,57.36\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"33.60,70.93 61.09,62.64 73.20,54.53 58.91,57.36\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><polygon points=\"97.14,60.00 60.00,57.71 45.71,60.00 60.00,62.29\" fill=\"#00000